00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:32.724
(chime)

00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:34.115
(door closing sound effect)

00:00:34.115 --> 00:00:36.698
(eerie music)

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.216
- [Cat Voiceover] That's dumb.

00:00:44.216 --> 00:00:45.149
Don't ignore the shadows

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:48.149
that lurk in the corner of your eye.

00:00:49.158 --> 00:00:51.190
They're watching you.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.558
The ancient Greeks called them Shades.

00:00:53.558 --> 00:00:55.967
In Korea, the phenomenon
is called "gawi nulim"

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:59.258
which means to be pressed down by a ghost.

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:01.016
Some believe these shadowy creatures

00:01:01.016 --> 00:01:03.377
are inter-dimensional
beings who are studying us

00:01:03.377 --> 00:01:05.776
for reasons unknown.

00:01:05.776 --> 00:01:09.168
I didn't believe in any of these myths,

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:11.526
but the fact that others
had experienced what I had

00:01:11.526 --> 00:01:12.359
made it more real to--

00:01:12.359 --> 00:01:13.297
(door opens)

00:01:13.297 --> 00:01:14.891
- Geez-o-pete, Cat,
it's one in the morning!

00:01:14.891 --> 00:01:15.990
What are you doing up?

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:16.923
- Reading.

00:01:16.923 --> 00:01:17.902
What are you doing up?

00:01:17.902 --> 00:01:19.893
- Don't get smart with me, missy.

00:01:19.893 --> 00:01:21.291
10 more minutes.

00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:22.349
- Fine.

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:24.349
(yawns)

00:01:26.283 --> 00:01:28.415
- [Cat Voiceover] I was 15
when I started seeing shadows

00:01:28.415 --> 00:01:30.298
in my peripheral vision.

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:32.996
My parents got divorced
and my mom and I moved

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:35.716
from DC to Roanoke, Virginia.

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:38.726
I had a hard time
sleeping in the new place.

00:01:38.726 --> 00:01:41.257
I was afraid of how quiet it was.

00:01:41.257 --> 00:01:43.346
I was afraid of the
seemingly endless woods

00:01:43.346 --> 00:01:45.806
that surrounded my house.

00:01:45.806 --> 00:01:47.147
But, mainly, I was afraid

00:01:47.147 --> 00:01:51.236
that when I laid in bed
at night I wasn't alone.

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.565
I couldn't see it at first,

00:01:52.565 --> 00:01:55.065
but I could feel its presence.

00:01:56.003 --> 00:02:00.843
Like a low frequency hum
vibrating just under my skin.

00:02:00.843 --> 00:02:03.176
And then one night I saw it,

00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:08.285
A dark void in the shape of a human.

00:02:08.285 --> 00:02:10.942
I tried to get up, but I couldn't move.

00:02:10.942 --> 00:02:14.534
I tried to scream, but nothing came out.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.576
It crawled over me,
brought its face to mine

00:02:17.576 --> 00:02:18.409
and then--

00:02:18.409 --> 00:02:19.242
(door opens)

00:02:19.242 --> 00:02:20.075
(screams)

00:02:20.075 --> 00:02:20.908
- Serves you right.

00:02:20.908 --> 00:02:23.074
Go to bed or I'm taking the computer.

00:02:23.074 --> 00:02:25.025
- Don't you ever knock?

00:02:25.025 --> 00:02:26.836
- Come on, sweetie, go to bed.

00:02:26.836 --> 00:02:27.669
It's late.

00:02:29.222 --> 00:02:30.450
Okay, goodnight.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.950
- Goodnight, jeez.

00:02:39.932 --> 00:02:42.932
(crickets chirping)

00:02:48.053 --> 00:02:50.778
(ghostly mumbling)

00:02:50.778 --> 00:02:53.614
(heavy breathing)

00:02:53.614 --> 00:02:56.614
(crickets chirping)

00:03:04.873 --> 00:03:06.396
(eerie music)

00:03:06.396 --> 00:03:08.824
(ghostly chant)

00:03:08.824 --> 00:03:11.324
(eerie music)

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.016
(static)

00:03:25.454 --> 00:03:28.454
(forced stammering)

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.205
(heavy breathing)

00:03:36.205 --> 00:03:39.622
(low frequency rumbling)

00:03:51.537 --> 00:03:53.504
- [Shadow] Kiss

00:03:53.504 --> 00:03:54.856
me.

00:03:54.856 --> 00:03:57.939
(intense high pitch)

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.755
(birds chirping)

00:04:01.755 --> 00:04:02.617
(scoffs)

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:04.367
- [Woman] Did you leave this on all night?

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:06.555
I'm not made of money, you know?

00:04:06.555 --> 00:04:10.722
If you're not up in 30 minutes
I'm dragging you out of bed.

00:04:13.114 --> 00:04:15.781
(intense music)

00:04:22.938 --> 00:04:25.854
(silent mouthing)

00:04:25.854 --> 00:04:28.937
(intensifying music)

00:04:30.825 --> 00:04:33.575
(menacing music)

